import AFTD.Prelude
import AFTD.Kb.Tcs.PrefixReversal

/-!
# prefix_reversal_group

Topic: combinatorics   Node: 168bcfc61448

Provenance: helper lemma. Helper for the interior-triple generation question in https://arxiv.org/html/2610.30892v1; classified boundary cases and the primitive-transposition criterion are in https://arxiv.org/html/2511.16959v1, Lemma 1 and Main Theorem.

The subgroup of the symmetric group on n positions generated by prefix reversals of lengths k, m and n.
-/

def prefix_reversal_group (n k m : ℕ) : Subgroup (Equiv.Perm (Fin n)) :=
  Subgroup.closure {prefixReversal n k, prefixReversal n m, prefixReversal n n}
